    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "341727a0_0a052914",
        "filename": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1851,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-28T11:52:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The current implementation iterates over l_listofInterfacesToUpdate and updates every matching interface found in extraInterfaces. std::find_if() would stop at the first match, so it is only suitable if we intend to update a single interface. Since l_listofInterfacesToUpdate is maintained as a list to support multiple interfaces in the future, using std::find_if() would require additional iteration to update the remaining interfaces. Therefore, it would not reduce the code or provide any efficiency benefit here.",
      "parentUuid": "6cc17716_dc9b0d43",
      "revId": "6bafbce314bc7ef2b16923af604ffd8eed6f0b70",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
